{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc 'cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/command-index.md\" <<'\"'MD'\n# Assessment command and output index\n\nThe target was only read through \"'`$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET`. Git commands used `env GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS=0 annex.merge-annex-branches=false annex.alwayscommit=false`; the inherited settings were preserved. No target write, replay, or scientific input retrieval occurred. The only failed Git attempt was a shell syntax error before Git ran; it is retained in `initial-git-command-error.txt`.\n\n- Frozen preflight: `logs/runner-check.stdout.txt`, `logs/runner-check.stderr.txt`.\n- Frozen complete-delivery probes: command was `\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" probes \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET\" -o probes.json --response response.json`; output is in `logs/probes.stdout.txt` and `logs/probes.stderr.txt`, full machine record in `../probes.json`.\n- Operational Git observations: `logs/git-status.stdout.txt`, `logs/git-status.stderr.txt`, `logs/git-log.stdout.txt`, `logs/git-log.stderr.txt`, `logs/git-remotes.stdout.txt`, `logs/git-remotes.stderr.txt`.\n- Documented single replay attempt: exact command and runner output in `logs/fresh-rerun.stdout.txt`, `logs/fresh-rerun.stderr.txt`; structured failure record in `../fresh-rerun.json`. It stopped before materialization or target execution.\n- Response editing commands: exact invocations in `logs/response-edits.commands.txt`; outputs/errors in matching `.stdout.txt` and `.stderr.txt` files, plus `logs/response-evidence-update.*`.\n- Frozen response table and encoding: `logs/response-table-final.stdout.txt`, `logs/response-table-final.stderr.txt`, `../2026-10-16-url.txt`, and `logs/response-encode-final.stderr.txt`.\n- Final validation: `logs/response-validate-final.*` and `logs/scientific-judgment-validate.*`.\n- Integrity audit: `logs/integrity-check-final.*`; structured result in `../operational-integrity.json`.\n- License-path inspection: `logs/license-paths.*` and `logs/vendored-license-head.stdout.txt`.\n- The report'\"'s scientific artifact readings cite capture-relative paths and manifest hashes; the source artifacts themselves remain in the retained canonical capture.\nMD\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport hashlib,json,os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nout=Path(os.environ['STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT']); rp=out/'2026-10-16-assessment.md'; sp=out/'scientific-judgment.json'\nx=json.loads(sp.read_text()); x['report']['sha256']=hashlib.sha256(rp.read_bytes()).hexdigest(); sp.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\n\\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" validate response.json > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/response-validate-final.stdout.txt\" 2> \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/response-validate-final.stderr.txt\"\n\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_SCIENTIFIC_JUDGMENT_VALIDATOR\" validate scientific-judgment.json --workspace \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\" --delivery-manifest \"$STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST\" > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/scientific-judgment-validate.stdout.txt\" 2> \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/scientific-judgment-validate.stderr.txt\"\ncat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/response-validate-final.stdout.txt\"; cat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/response-validate-final.stderr.txt\"; cat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/scientific-judgment-validate.stdout.txt\"; cat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/scientific-judgment-validate.stderr.txt\"\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
